WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:01:50.000
<b> #10
Day Off</b>

00:02:02.540 --> 00:02:03.930
<i>I'm going to be late.</i>

00:02:03.930 --> 00:02:05.360
<i>I have to hurry.</i>

00:02:07.610 --> 00:02:09.510
<i>Who could it be at this hour?</i>

00:02:12.820 --> 00:02:15.600
What are you doing here... Sis?

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.730
What am I doing here?

00:02:19.220 --> 00:02:21.570
We set this up a while ago.

00:02:21.570 --> 00:02:22.570
No, really.

00:02:22.910 --> 00:02:24.270
I'm going to be late for work.

00:02:24.270 --> 00:02:25.720
Can you give me a break?

00:02:26.380 --> 00:02:28.280
You don't have work today.

00:02:28.280 --> 00:02:30.610
No, today's Monday.

00:02:29.790 --> 00:02:31.250
<b>Checking the day</b>

00:02:31.880 --> 00:02:33.280
It's a public holiday.

00:02:33.280 --> 00:02:35.540
Yeah, that's why I'm here.

00:02:36.560 --> 00:02:37.870
Thank you for having me!

00:02:37.870 --> 00:02:38.800
Come on in.

00:02:38.800 --> 00:02:41.170
Here's your drawing set.

00:02:41.170 --> 00:02:42.360
Thank you!

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:46.220
All right, Mommy's going to come 
back for you around dinner.

00:02:46.220 --> 00:02:49.080
Until then, I want you to have 
fun with Uncle Takayuki.

00:02:49.080 --> 00:02:50.550
I will!

00:02:50.940 --> 00:02:52.220
Here's lunch.

00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:53.770
There's enough for you, too.

00:02:54.360 --> 00:02:55.410
Take care.

00:02:57.770 --> 00:02:59.330
See you later, Ricchan.

00:02:59.560 --> 00:03:00.370
Okay!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:05.180
Why don't we go into the living room?

00:03:05.180 --> 00:03:06.410
All right.

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:11.910
Ricchan, are you hungry?

00:03:11.910 --> 00:03:13.280
I'm fine.

00:03:13.280 --> 00:03:15.760
Then I'll have breakfast.

00:03:16.090 --> 00:03:19.080
You mean you still haven't 
had your breakfast?

00:03:19.560 --> 00:03:23.810
I overslept, so I'm just 
now having breakfast.

00:03:24.040 --> 00:03:25.310
I see.

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:28.260
My daddy oversleeps, too, on his days off.

00:03:29.120 --> 00:03:30.420
Does he now?

00:03:49.190 --> 00:03:50.900
<i>A precious day off.</i>

00:03:51.550 --> 00:03:53.880
<i>I would've liked to sleep longer.</i>

00:03:55.570 --> 00:03:58.090
<i>This won't exactly be a restful day.</i>

00:03:58.370 --> 00:04:01.400
Oh, right! So, Uncle?

00:04:01.400 --> 00:04:02.060
Yes?

00:04:02.300 --> 00:04:06.000
Is it true that you're going to 
Koguma Land with me and Mommy?

00:04:06.980 --> 00:04:09.340
I vaguely remember promising that, too.

00:04:09.340 --> 00:04:10.800
All right!

00:04:10.800 --> 00:04:14.350
If my husband can't get that 
day off, you'll come, won't you?

00:04:15.180 --> 00:04:19.810
I'd like to take her there once 
before the next child is born.

00:04:19.810 --> 00:04:21.300
<i>I remember her saying that, too.</i>

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:26.940
<i>My sister is going to be a mother of two.</i>

00:04:47.000 --> 00:04:48.450
Hey, hey, Uncle?

00:04:48.450 --> 00:04:49.070
Yes?

00:04:49.070 --> 00:04:51.670
I'm going to be a big sister soon!

00:04:51.670 --> 00:04:52.690
Did you know?

00:04:52.690 --> 00:04:53.930
I did hear that.

00:04:54.180 --> 00:04:56.940
My mommy has a baby in her tummy!

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.370
That's amazing.

00:04:59.020 --> 00:05:03.360
And then, I asked her how come daddy's 
tummy wasn't getting big, too,

00:05:03.360 --> 00:05:06.520
and she told me that only 
women's tummies get big.

00:05:06.520 --> 00:05:07.970
Did you know that?

00:05:07.970 --> 00:05:09.500
I did hear that.

00:05:09.740 --> 00:05:10.910
<b>B
a
m</b>

00:05:09.870 --> 00:05:12.250
So that's why you don't have children, huh?

00:05:12.250 --> 00:05:14.540
I wouldn't say that's the reason.

00:05:14.540 --> 00:05:17.730
Oh right, you have to be married.

00:05:17.730 --> 00:05:19.490
You really know a lot of things.

00:05:19.490 --> 00:05:21.120
I'll teach you all sorts of things!

00:05:21.120 --> 00:05:21.910
All right.

