00:07:35.210 --> 00:07:37.730
Then if you don't mind, I'll come along.

00:07:37.730 --> 00:07:41.510
<i>For a second, I thought he was a dangerous guy.</i>

00:07:41.510 --> 00:07:44.480
It's a bit of a walk from here, though.

00:07:44.480 --> 00:07:46.480
<i>He seems like a nice kid.</i>

