isn't too bad either.</i>

00:09:22.100 --> 00:09:24.240
Should we ask my sister to come here, too?

00:09:24.240 --> 00:09:25.540
Mommy's coming here, too?

00:09:25.540 --> 00:09:26.930
I say yes!

